  "notes": [
    "All 24 screenshot stories were captured from the current isolated unpacked Chrome extension UI, including each locale’s actual controls.",
    "Four devices in every story: iPhone 18 Pro in Burgundy, iPhone Duo unfolded in portrait, MacBook Pro 14-inch (M5), and Apple Watch Series 6 (40mm).",
    "Actual UI divider drags set columns to 205, 295, 613 and 167 px. Main frame heights differ by less than 0.5 px around 350 px; the Watch is about 153 px tall. Frame artwork is uniformly scaled.",
    "Scroll screenshots use a real 220 px wheel gesture with sync enabled. Resulting scroll offsets: 220, 220, 84 (page end), 220.",
    "Each annotation capture imports its localized actual overview PNG through the design-reference input and uses the actual Box, Arrow and Text controls. Native activeTab capture permission was not bypassed or claimed validated by this artwork workflow.",
    "Promo hardware crops and screenshots are real extension output. Only the app icon is a generated illustration based on the previous icon and real-device references.",
    "Raw crops exclude viewport toolbars. Final artwork and all 24 screenshots retain their specified upload dimensions."
  ],
